From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:15:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2165/3799] soh: rename D_809070CC -> sLimbPosIndices

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: per-limb slot in unk_234[] where the first skeleton records that limb's world position
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c      | 4 ++--
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
index 612e40355..d8e0c8072 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
@@ -2617,8 +2617,8 @@ void BossGanon2_PostLimbDraw(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Vec3s*
     D_80907120.z = 17000.0f;
     D_8090712C.z = 3000.0f;
 
-    if (D_809070CC[limbIndex] >= 0) {
-        Matrix_MultVec3f(&sOrigin, &this->unk_234[D_809070CC[limbIndex]]);  // was D_80906D60 [LLM:HIGH]
+    if (sLimbPosIndices[limbIndex] >= 0) {  // was D_809070CC [LLM:HIGH]
+        Matrix_MultVec3f(&sOrigin, &this->unk_234[sLimbPosIndices[limbIndex]]);  // was D_80906D60 [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 
     if (limbIndex == 15) {
diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c
